flowchart LR
    client[Client]
    iam[Auth Service / IAM]
    users[(Users, roles, permissions)]
    refresh[(Hashed refresh tokens)]
    jwt{{Signed access JWT\nsub, roles, permissions, iss, aud, exp}}
    messaging[Messaging Service]
    messaging_data[(Conversations and messages)]
    other[Other downstream service]
    other_data[(Its own domain data)]

    client -->|email + password| iam
    iam -->|verify credentials| users
    iam -->|store / rotate opaque refresh token| refresh
    iam -->|issue short-lived JWT| client

    client -->|Bearer JWT| messaging
    messaging -->|verify signature, issuer, audience, expiry locally| jwt
    messaging -->|authorise: permission + conversation membership| messaging_data

    client -->|Bearer JWT| other
    other -->|verify JWT locally| jwt
    other -->|authorise its own resources| other_data

    classDef iam fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554
    classDef token fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef service fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    class iam iam,users,refresh
    class jwt token
    class messaging,other,messaging_data,other_data service
